@startuml seq-sign-in
actor Person
participant App
participant "Wallet Core" as WC
participant "Home network" as Net

alt create an account
  Person -> App : Create account (name, @username)
  App -> App : new passkey with PRF → Mera derives the EVM key
  App -> Net : account address (factory, CREATE2)
else sign in
  Person -> App : Sign in
  App -> App : fingerprint → Mera derives the EVM key
  App -> WC : which account and owners does it know?
  App -> Net : checks the key is an owner
end
App -> WC : SIWE message signed by the account (ERC-1271 / ERC-6492)
WC -> Net : checks the signature and the owners
WC --> App : session (24 h)
note over WC
  A new account passes Turnstile.
  If the database were lost, the account is found
  onchain and registered again.
end note
@enduml
